{"id":2386,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为丰富校园文化生活，进一步激发学生的创造力与动手实践能力，让学子近距离感受传统手工技艺的独特魅力，4月12日下午，由中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院举办的手工皮具工坊体验活动，在七楼自习室顺利开展，众多热爱手工、热衷创意实践的同学踊跃报名、积极参与，在沉浸式手作体验中收获满满。</p><p><strong><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=4MzV8kUmM2ozCsLiz7sL4MfLmC8M8LDsUmUZU4N4L8CaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRUYyiM1yaM8VRM4GYMmUPn7MVnz-DLzTfnllaUNlDnmQFLR7DUmvYMRrFMzTVL4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8L4-sgtA8pUscc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34327&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FCC5607AC702641DCEE2619AEE0BE6F6/016B7245/59E35\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=4MzV8kUmM2ozCsLiz7sL4MfLmC8M8LDsUmUZU4N4L8CaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRUYyiM1yaM8VRM4GYMmUPn7MVnz-DLzTfnllaUNlDnmQFLR7DUmvYMRrFMzTVL4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8L4-sgtA8pUscc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34327&e=.png\"></strong></p><p>活动伊始，工作人员提前布置好活动场地，整齐摆放好各类原料、针线、工具、装饰配件等物料，为同学们营造了温馨且有序的创作环境。参与活动的同学们全神贯注、兴致盎然，纷纷化身“手工匠人”，全身心投入到创作之中。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=4oRC8DMmWfM4Q2Mi8CPM7-sU8C4olWD7nlUiM4lZLmCPUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4MYhfMSh2LlW2MzW7LlCPU8lDM87snllDMmM2MNVRLNQFoz7DoRv4MmTFMzNZL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8L4-sgtA8pUscc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34327&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/337A5F1BF52D1F1CE67A7EE663F6AC2F/91687369/5980B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=4oRC8DMmWfM4Q2Mi8CPM7-sU8C4olWD7nlUiM4lZLmCPUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4MYhfMSh2LlW2MzW7LlCPU8lDM87snllDMmM2MNVRLNQFoz7DoRv4MmTFMzNZL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8L4-sgtA8pUscc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34327&e=.png\"></p><p>经过一个多小时的精心制作，一件件小巧精致、个性十足的钥匙扣、皮质挂件陆续完成。此次活动将动手实践与美育熏陶相结合，不仅让大家体验到手工创作的乐趣，放松了身心，也进一步丰富了书院文化活动形式，营造了积极向上、温馨和谐的社区氛围。</p><p></p><p>一审一校 张含梦</p><p>二审二校 王熠暄</p><p>三审三校 王慧慧</p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=4MzV8kUmM2ozCsLiz7sL4MfLmC8M8LDsUmUZU4N4L8CaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRUYyiM1yaM8VRM4GYMmUPn7MVnz-DLzTfnllaUNlDnmQFLR7DUmvYMRrFMzTVL4lJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8L4-sgtA8pUscc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34327&e=.png"}